# The review round (reviews/2026-10-28-g10/findings.md), by coordinates: the doubled ink corners
# under the rim (8,12 15,12) and at the base (8,20 15,20) go; the body gets a 2-3 px lit side
# (clay3, clay4) and a far side and bottom in clay1 and clay0, so it no longer reads as the
# ground's colour inside a ring; then the urn moves down a row to stand on the cell's bottom.
paint 4,12 <<
  ...0443333220...
  ..044333332220..
  .04455333332220.
  0445433333322210
  0444333333322210
  0443333332222110
  .04333333222110.
  ..033333222110..
  ...0332222220...
  ....02221110....
>>
